# Generated by Cargo
# will have compiled files and executables
debug
target

# Cert
*.p12

# These are backup files generated by rustfmt
**/*.rs.bk

# MSVC Windows builds of rustc generate these, which store debugging information
*.pdb

# Generated by cargo mutants
# Contains mutation testing data
**/mutants.out*/

# Apple
*.DS_Store

# Kotlin build artifacts created by tests
**/.kotlin/

agent-plan.md

# Temporary files generated by tools and AI
*.py
tmp 
*.temp
*.tmp
*.profraw

# Coverage reports
coverage.json
coverage_summary.md

# Rust Code Analysis Results
analysis_results/
CODE_SIMPLICITY.*

# Temporary files during development. Ahma's own operational logs default to
# .ahma/logs/, which is gitignored automatically via .ahma/.gitignore; this
# broader pattern remains as a general fallback for other logs/ directories.
**/logs/
**/temp/

# Release signing private keys — NEVER commit
# Keys are generated and stored exclusively inside GitHub Actions secrets.
# Release signing: no key files. Trust is established via GitHub Build Provenance Attestations.
release_key.pem
ahma-release-new.pem
*.private.pem

# Local session files
.ahma/session.toml

# Local Ahma exports
.ahma/exports/

# Local secrets (Apple Developer ID signing / notarization credentials, etc.)
# NEVER commit — mirrors the values pushed to GitHub repo secrets for R-SIGN.1.
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
.secrets/
*.p12
*.p8
*.certSigningRequest

# Local example logs for debugging
example-logs/
